- The `network` option should support an array form for ordered matching, similar to how `Bun.serve` processes routes:
  ```javascript
  network: [
    { pattern: "**/ads/**", action: (ctx) => ctx.respond({ status: 204 }) },
    { pattern: "**", action: (ctx) => ctx.continue() },
  ]
  ```
